---
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-16">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="text-[11px] font-light tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-deep">About Sinclair</p>
        <div class="mt-6 h-px w-10 bg-deep/40"></div>
        <h2 class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-3xl font-light leading-[1.35] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-charcoal sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
          style="font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 300;">
          Boutique by design.<br />Global by connection.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-2xl lg:pt-12" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-base font-light leading-[1.8] text-charcoal/70">
          At Sinclair Yachting, exceptional service begins with understanding people.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base font-light leading-[1.8] text-charcoal/70">
          We guide, advise and connect, bringing together the right expertise, industry relationships and trusted professionals at every stage of your yachting journey.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base font-light leading-[1.8] text-charcoal/70">
          Whether you are arranging a charter, managing a project or exploring ownership, we act as your dedicated advisor. We quietly coordinate the people and details behind the scenes, so every experience feels effortless.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base font-light leading-[1.8] text-charcoal/70">
          True luxury is having the right team around you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
